  ('Bethel A moving up the table', 'bethel-a-moving-up-the-table', 'Match Reports', '[]'::jsonb, 'A week of breaks sees Gary Spencer top the charts with a 60 break as Bugle A maintain there lead at the top of the Victory League', 'A week of breaks sees Gary Spencer top the charts with a 60 break as Bugle A maintain there lead at the top of the Victory League', 'Mevagissey A remain unbeaten after a 4-1 victory at Bugle B', 'Bethel A have moved up to joint 2nd in the Victory League after a 4-1 win at Tregonissey B. Bob Stephens knocked in a 37 break to get them off to a good start which Garry Stephens increased but Darren Roberts black ball win over Mark Ashton cut the deficit but Matt Green and Andy Peers black ball win over Ryan Orchard completed the win.

