St Blazey B stay joint top after taking 4 points at home to Gorran Haven. Martin Richards, Clive Stuthridge, George Taylor and Gavin Dyche (40 break) all won with Warren Ball getting the away point.

Graham Hoskin and Les Shakespeare got Lerryns 2 frames at home to Bethel C with Roger Smithson, Leigh Rosevear and Howard Brett''s sealing the win.

Bethel B got there 1st win beating Tregonissey C 4-1. Terry and Craig Nicholls along with Aedy Dyche and Matt Moore securing wins with Darren Elliott getting Treggys point keeping them 2nd bottom.

