  ('Defeat for the leaders as Tregonissey A beat Bugle A', 'defeat-for-the-leaders-as-tregonissey-a-beat-bugle-a', 'Match Reports', '[]'::jsonb, 'Leaders of the Victory league suffered a 3-2 defeat at Tregonissey A but still hold a healthy lead as other results went there way.', 'Leaders of the Victory league suffered a 3-2 defeat at Tregonissey A but still hold a healthy lead as other results went there way.', 'Mevagissey A continue there dominatety lead in the Rees league seeing of Lerryn 4-1 as only Graham Hoskins win against Darren Powell saved the whitewash.', 'Andrew Best knocked in a 32 break to get them going but Jason Cocks 35 and Ryan Bilson 45 put treggy ahead then Justin Oxenham levelled things up leaving Geoff Merriman to defeat Josh Bristow in the last to claim the home win.

