  ('Tregonissey A on a roll', 'tregonissey-a-on-a-roll', 'Match Reports', '[]'::jsonb, 'A great 4-1 win at Mevagissey B saw Tregonissey A jump up to 3rd in the Victory League.', 'A great 4-1 win at Mevagissey B saw Tregonissey A jump up to 3rd in the Victory League.', 'Gavin Dyche had a 33 break and Nick Ferguson a 36 as St Blazey B got the 1st 3 frames', 'Ryan Bilson,Jason Cocks and Kevin Harris put them 3 up before Matt Rowe beat Harrison Burdon on the Black to pull one back for the home side only for Geoff Merriman to beat Ben Rothwell again on the Black to seal a big win.

