  ('Tregonissey A scrape through', 'tregonissey-a-scrape-through', 'Competitions', '[]'::jsonb, 'In the Team pairs quarter finals Tregonissey A scraped through against St Blazey B after drawing 2 each but going through having scored 10 more points on the night.', 'Andrew Gooch and Kevin Harris won the 1st frame by 59 points against Gavin Dyche and Nick Ferguson but Clive Stuthridge and Josh Bristow won the next 2 frames reducing the deficit to a single point but Geoff Merriman and Jason Cocks won the last on the Black to proceed to the semi''s.', 'Bugle won a rearranged league game at home to Bethel B taking all 5 frames', 'Luxulyan picked up a fine 3-1 win at St Neot with Andrew Best and Harrison Burdon winning both there frames and went into the last frame with a 58 point advantage which Justin Oxenham and Gary Spencer increased beating Darren Lock and Chris Perring.

