  ('Bethel grab runabout shield', 'bethel-grab-runabout-shield', 'Match Reports', '[]'::jsonb, 'Bethel A went to close rivals Tregonissey A and won by the odd frame to claim back the runabout shield  and move a further point ahead at the top of the Victory league, Andrew gooch won both frames for the home side.', 'Bethel A went to close rivals Tregonissey A and won by the odd frame to claim back the runabout shield and move a further point ahead at the top of the Victory league, Andrew gooch won both frames for the home side.', 'Bugle got a great 4-1 home win against leaders St Blazey A in the Rees league', 'Luxulyan closed the gap on the treggy boys after beating struggling Bethel D by 4 frames to 1 Liam Jones was the home sides only success beating Justin Oxenham but Harrison Burdon Andrew Best, Paul Sturtridge and Gary Spencer all won for the visitors.

Darren Lock knocked in a seasons equalling high break of 53 helping St Neot get a couple of points at resurgent Pelynt with Steve Courts also winning as Paul Woodman, Jamie Daniell and Phil Ormond got the home points.

